OL,3,GNEWSANo plans for further cuts at
OL,4,Ahospitals, say trusts
OL,5,
OL,6,FNHS bosses insist they have no plans to
OL,7,Fclose or reduce services at two rural
OL,8,Fhospitals despite concerns for their
OL,9,Ffuture.
OL,11,FTwo NHS trusts have acknowledged that
OL,12,Fsome clinics had been withdrawn at
OL,13,FNorth Cambridgeshire Hospital in
OL,14,FWisbech and Doddington Hospital in
OL,15,FCambridgeshire.
OL,17,FA report due before Cambridgeshire
OL,18,FCounty Council's Health Scrutiny
OL,19,FCommittee on 1 October said there were
OL,20,Fconcerns about healthcare access in
OL,21,Fdeprived Fenland communities.
